{"version": 2, "width": 132, "height": 40, "timestamp": 1793638513, "title": "Mariano's collector 1.8.0rc5 walkthrough, part 3: the delivered release, offline (recorded 2026-11-02)", "env": {"SHELL": "bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0.0, "o", "# Mariano's collector: walkthrough, PART 3 (recorded 2026-11-02 on Hamza's workstation, Windows 11, NOT on the\r\n"]
[0.344, "o", "# client's VM). Every command runs for real while it is recorded; nothing is typed in afterwards.\r\n"]
[0.703, "o", "#\r\n"]
[1.047, "o", "# Parts 1 and 2 recorded the live run Q2 (01M6E5V6CASQ8F00VC8PE9TFYW) on release 1.8.0rc4 at Vernon Hills Pickup.\r\n"]
[1.406, "o", "# Q2 was rejected by two gates: G3 (Cat Food: 231 of the 232 products the site reports) and G13 (integrity).\r\n"]
[1.75, "o", "# The G13 rejection was a defect of ours: two fetches of a page that Oxylabs never delivered (HTTP 500 on every\r\n"]
[2.094, "o", "# attempt, not charged) were counted as unverified pages, although no record depends on them.\r\n"]
[2.453, "o", "#\r\n"]
[2.797, "o", "# This part shows the DELIVERED release, 1.8.0rc5, which fixes that, OFFLINE: no request is sent to Mariano's or\r\n"]
[3.156, "o", "# to any provider. 1.8.0rc5 HAS NOT RUN LIVE: its first live run is still pending, and so is the client's full\r\n"]
[3.5, "o", "# category list (only CSV rows 22-27 were collected, as a qualification scope).\r\n"]
[3.859, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.859, "o", "$ sha256sum MARIANOS_SOURCE_1.8.0rc5.zip; marianos-collector --version (from its clean extraction)\r\n"]
[3.984, "o", "1832ef6e5051f20e55842057b60d37a61924e1af92d360fea6ae810104481485 *MARIANOS_SOURCE_1.8.0rc5.zip\r\n"]
[7.781, "o", "marianos-azure-headless 1.8.0rc5\r\n"]
[8.063, "o", "commit ee5ec99b27bf68f63f6026a5b2e97937abccc5d3\r\n"]
[8.063, "o", "marianos-azure-headless 1.8.0rc5: no integrity failure for a page the provider never brought\r\n"]
[8.078, "o", "[exit 0]\r\n"]
[8.078, "o", "\r\n"]
[8.078, "o", "$ git diff --stat 1.8.0rc4 (9d16475) .. 1.8.0rc5 (ee5ec99)\r\n"]
[8.188, "o", " headless/marianos-azure-headless/pyproject.toml    |  2 +-\r\n"]
